    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the battlefield of <i>FloorBreaker</i>\u2014where skill, strategy, and a touch of satisfying destruction collide!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your opponent stand on opposite sides of the arena, with only layers of fragile floor beneath your feet. There\u2019s only one thing to do:<br><strong>Fire your ball with precision, break the floor under your enemy, and send them plunging into the abyss!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch bouncing balls to destroy the floor beneath your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arena is symmetrical\u2014you can\u2019t cross the line. All attacks come from your aim and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your step. One wrong move, and you fall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Unique Characters &amp; Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has its own special mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, fun to master\u2014with plenty of room for high-level play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Diverse Items &amp; Arena Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power bounce, ice magic, material swap...<br>Dozens of battle modifiers make every match unpredictable and wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Solo or Up to 4 Players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge smart AI in solo mode,or grab your friends for intense local multiplayer mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to play? Grab your ball, smash their footing\u2014</strong><br><strong>and watch them fall, fast and hard!</strong> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the battlefield of <i>FloorBreaker</i>\u2014where skill, strategy, and a touch of satisfying destruction collide!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your opponent stand on opposite sides of the arena, with only layers of fragile floor beneath your feet. There\u2019s only one thing to do:<br><strong>Fire your ball with precision, break the floor under your enemy, and send them plunging into the abyss!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch bouncing balls to destroy the floor beneath your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arena is symmetrical\u2014you can\u2019t cross the line. All attacks come from your aim and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your step. One wrong move, and you fall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Unique Characters &amp; Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has its own special mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, fun to master\u2014with plenty of room for high-level play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Diverse Items &amp; Arena Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power bounce, ice magic, material swap...<br>Dozens of battle modifiers make every match unpredictable and wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Solo or Up to 4 Players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge smart AI in solo mode,or grab your friends for intense local multiplayer mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to play? Grab your ball, smash their footing\u2014</strong><br><strong>and watch them fall, fast and hard!</strong> </p>",
